WEBVTT

01:40.690 --> 01:45.800
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.370 --> 01:50.550
[Episode 2]

01:51.229 --> 01:53.570
Brothers, take the lady out first.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.810
Then what about him?

02:05.120 --> 02:06.510
Ignorant boy.

02:06.530 --> 02:08.150
You think this is enough

02:08.150 --> 02:09.830
to break my poison formation?

02:10.530 --> 02:11.500
Dream on!

03:18.060 --> 03:19.640
There's actually

03:19.910 --> 03:22.710
such a mighty prodigy from the human race.

03:22.840 --> 03:26.590
You've made me think twice about killing a talent like you.

03:28.400 --> 03:29.460
I'll let you leave.

03:30.030 --> 03:32.950
I came for the Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord's demon core.

03:32.950 --> 03:34.579
I won't leave empty-handed.

03:37.710 --> 03:39.680
I heard what you said

03:40.810 --> 03:42.430
at the Star-Picking Tower.

03:42.470 --> 03:45.870
Isn't it just that the Yiqi Alliance wants to attack Nanchui?

03:46.160 --> 03:47.160
Let them come!

03:48.070 --> 03:50.110
I won't let anyone take away

03:50.360 --> 03:51.960
my nephew's demon core.

03:52.680 --> 03:54.290
Are you trying to protect your relative

03:54.290 --> 03:57.910
and let thousands of little demons in Nanchui die for it, Demon King?

03:57.910 --> 03:59.120
So what?

03:59.230 --> 04:00.720
The Nangongs

04:01.520 --> 04:03.720
won't benefit from it either.

04:03.870 --> 04:06.760
Forsaking emotions, pursuing hatred; eternal night befalls.

04:06.760 --> 04:08.640
Sir, you know this prophecy

04:09.410 --> 04:11.640
is warning both humans and demons

04:11.680 --> 04:13.260
to pull themselves back from the brink

04:13.260 --> 04:14.920
and stop fighting each other.

04:23.350 --> 04:25.630
I've only been in seclusion for a year,

04:26.360 --> 04:28.560
and you just caused such a big disaster.

04:28.830 --> 04:29.920
Get back there now!

04:31.400 --> 04:33.530
Does the promise you made to me earlier

04:34.510 --> 04:35.970
still stand?

04:36.120 --> 04:37.720
I'll add one more condition.

04:38.270 --> 04:39.510
If I get your demon core,

04:39.510 --> 04:41.770
I promise I'll try my best to save Nanchui

04:41.900 --> 04:45.000
and make Nangong Ye pay the price.

04:50.630 --> 04:51.510
Good!

04:53.630 --> 04:54.560
Very good.

05:12.360 --> 05:13.510
You little dummy,

05:14.040 --> 05:15.560
I'll protect you.

05:15.720 --> 05:17.250
So you have nothing to fear.

05:18.430 --> 05:19.990
Uncle, you should protect

05:20.540 --> 05:22.750
those demons like Lady Poison's people,

05:22.750 --> 05:24.150
who have no desire to kill

05:24.610 --> 05:26.540
and only want to lead

05:26.560 --> 05:28.260
a peaceful life in Nanchui.

05:29.680 --> 05:30.600
Let me go.

06:07.380 --> 06:11.610
♪The soul wandering in destiny♪

06:12.770 --> 06:15.090
♪It melts in your♪

06:16.160 --> 06:18.730
♪Gentle gaze♪

06:21.560 --> 06:25.730
♪I trace your silhouette with my fingertips♪

06:26.930 --> 06:28.840
♪Reduced into ashes♪

06:30.030 --> 06:32.770
♪I'm still looking for you♪

06:35.150 --> 06:36.870
♪I used to be like the wind, searching♪

06:37.290 --> 06:38.390
♪Every nook and cranny♪

06:39.120 --> 06:40.650
♪And I was once like water, asking♪

06:40.680 --> 06:42.720
It was my fault

06:40.740 --> 06:41.650
♪Every lake♪

06:42.210 --> 06:43.850
♪I swallow the growing thorns♪

06:43.120 --> 06:44.430
to act recklessly.

06:44.350 --> 06:46.210
♪Lost in love's bitter toll♪

06:46.040 --> 06:48.040
But I sought revenge for Lady Poison

06:47.500 --> 06:49.070
♪Yet I heard the pulse♪

06:49.560 --> 06:51.310
and built this Star-Picking Tower.

06:50.150 --> 06:53.140
♪Letting everything rise from the void♪

06:53.440 --> 06:54.820
I did nothing wrong.

06:54.090 --> 06:56.830
♪Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession♪

06:57.810 --> 07:00.170
♪And love drowns me♪

06:58.390 --> 06:59.630
I don't regret it.

07:01.250 --> 07:04.380
♪In the fatal ecstasy♪

07:05.120 --> 07:07.690
♪If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple♪

07:08.600 --> 07:11.380
♪Lurking in the dark♪

07:12.000 --> 07:13.310
♪If I can look♪

07:14.120 --> 07:16.980
♪Into your eyes, lingering♪

07:17.810 --> 07:20.060
♪And falling♪

07:34.000 --> 07:37.880
♪The soul wandering in destiny♪

07:39.250 --> 07:41.430
♪It melts in your♪

07:40.760 --> 07:41.680
Demon Lord!

07:42.330 --> 07:44.970
♪Gentle gaze♪

07:43.120 --> 07:44.100
Demon Lord...

07:44.510 --> 07:45.360
My dear.

07:47.940 --> 07:52.010
♪I trace your silhouette with my fingertips♪

07:48.930 --> 07:51.020
I want you to live well

07:53.150 --> 07:54.990
♪Reduced into ashes♪

07:55.040 --> 07:56.310
in your new home.

07:55.830 --> 07:59.080
♪I'm still looking for you♪

08:01.510 --> 08:03.500
♪I was once like a stubborn flower♪

08:03.810 --> 08:05.000
♪Blooming in the desert♪

08:05.470 --> 08:07.100
♪The withered grass extinguished♪

08:07.460 --> 08:08.480
♪The flames of the eternal night♪

08:08.860 --> 08:10.650
♪The thorns all over the body illuminate♪

08:09.190 --> 08:10.040
Demon Lord...

08:11.050 --> 08:13.410
♪Love's bitter toll♪

08:14.200 --> 08:15.940
♪Piercing through all the tenderness♪

08:16.850 --> 08:19.910
♪Letting everything rise from the void♪

08:20.790 --> 08:23.620
♪Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession♪

08:24.510 --> 08:26.940
♪And love drowns me♪

08:27.950 --> 08:31.180
♪In the fatal ecstasy♪

08:31.820 --> 08:34.390
♪If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple♪

08:35.299 --> 08:38.330
♪Lurking in the dark♪

08:38.700 --> 08:39.909
♪If I can look♪

08:40.799 --> 08:43.679
♪Into your eyes, lingering♪

08:44.510 --> 08:48.070
♪Letting everything rise from the void♪

08:49.100 --> 08:51.770
♪Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession♪

08:52.610 --> 08:55.170
♪And love drowns me♪

08:56.100 --> 08:59.280
♪In the fatal ecstasy♪

08:59.990 --> 09:02.620
♪If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple♪

09:03.420 --> 09:06.240
♪Lurking in the dark♪

09:06.800 --> 09:07.960
♪If I can look♪

09:07.940 --> 09:09.430
He has already paid for his sins.

09:08.910 --> 09:12.110
♪Into your eyes, lingering♪

09:10.030 --> 09:12.230
You can take him to cultivate over again

09:12.510 --> 09:14.360
and turn over a new leaf.

09:13.330 --> 09:16.980
♪And falling♪

09:24.850 --> 09:26.800
His last wish was for you

09:27.390 --> 09:28.720
to live well.

09:37.150 --> 09:37.840
Demon Lord,

09:38.800 --> 09:43.200
I'm willing to keep you company while cultivating for another thousand years.

09:55.240 --> 09:57.370
-Huaizhu!
-I didn't even use this one.

09:57.680 --> 09:58.600
Look at Miss Dongfang.

09:58.600 --> 09:59.150
Huaizhu,

09:59.630 --> 10:01.910
did you crack that hard nut, the Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord?

10:01.910 --> 10:02.790
How did you make it?

10:02.790 --> 10:04.270
Did you get into any trouble?

10:04.270 --> 10:05.870
Not just the Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord!

10:05.870 --> 10:08.030
We also ran into the Nanchui Poison King,

10:08.030 --> 10:10.440
Huandu Qingtian, a Great Demon King-level figure

10:10.440 --> 10:12.450
with three thousand years of cultivation.

10:12.450 --> 10:14.440
As the so-called invincible Huandu,

10:14.440 --> 10:15.200
he still got

10:15.200 --> 10:16.550
beaten up by us, huh?

10:16.550 --> 10:17.440
That's exaggerated.

10:17.440 --> 10:18.770
It could count as a draw.

10:20.870 --> 10:22.320
Did you get hurt?

10:23.120 --> 10:25.270
Was it a hero saving a beauty in danger,

10:25.440 --> 10:27.000
or a beauty saving a hero?

10:28.330 --> 10:29.570
Miss, you must be tired.

10:29.570 --> 10:31.390
Would you like some water?

10:32.270 --> 10:33.800
Let me fetch it for Huaizhu.

10:39.790 --> 10:40.920
You go give it to her.

10:41.260 --> 10:42.520
You've been poisoned.

10:45.550 --> 10:46.280
Come with me.

10:54.960 --> 10:56.600
Hmm, fishy.

11:06.670 --> 11:07.840
You've inhaled too much

11:07.840 --> 11:09.600
of the Poison King's toxic mist.

11:09.600 --> 11:10.660
Take the pill in it,

11:10.910 --> 11:13.770
work your energy for 15 minutes, and you'll be fine.

11:21.270 --> 11:22.130
Your scabbard.

11:23.260 --> 11:25.690
Actually, miss, your spiritual fire can neutralize poison.

11:25.690 --> 11:27.750
You didn't need my protection at all.

11:27.920 --> 11:29.920
I was kind of cocky asking you to stay

11:30.840 --> 11:32.440
within 10 steps away from me.

11:33.840 --> 11:34.510
Alright,

11:35.150 --> 11:36.880
let me return this to its owner.

11:39.210 --> 11:40.670
I should take my leave now.

11:41.030 --> 11:41.960
Thank you, miss.

11:42.270 --> 11:42.870
Take care.

11:50.630 --> 11:51.440
Qinlan,

11:52.510 --> 11:53.080
let's go.

12:05.810 --> 12:07.500
[Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

12:09.270 --> 12:12.630
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

12:10.080 --> 12:11.720
On July 7th, see you

12:11.720 --> 12:13.780
at the Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai.

12:25.200 --> 12:26.270
See you there.

12:36.550 --> 12:37.280
Poison King,

12:37.750 --> 12:39.840
are you really letting them go so easily like this?

12:39.840 --> 12:41.840
They are helping Nanchui.

12:43.160 --> 12:44.820
The sword from the Wangquans,

12:45.240 --> 12:46.840
the fire from the Dongfangs.

12:48.900 --> 12:52.590
Perhaps the status quo is really going to change drastically.

12:53.750 --> 12:55.550
The Divine Fire did show up here.

12:55.690 --> 12:57.420
But the Wangquan Sword? Where?

12:57.530 --> 12:59.260
Although he used a trick

12:59.670 --> 13:02.850
to hide his identity with a different sword technique,

13:03.030 --> 13:06.790
it couldn't fool my eyes.

13:08.240 --> 13:10.270
It's time

13:10.700 --> 13:12.370
for Old Nangong to pay

13:15.120 --> 13:16.380
for all his evil deeds.

13:19.520 --> 13:20.910
Hurry! Move quickly!

13:21.790 --> 13:22.950
Hurry up! Run!

13:24.000 --> 13:24.510
Come on!

13:25.510 --> 13:26.220
Run!

13:39.750 --> 13:40.280
Quickly!

13:40.730 --> 13:41.320
Hurry!

13:46.240 --> 13:46.960
Run faster!

13:48.390 --> 13:49.300
Sister...

13:50.830 --> 13:51.920
Run!

13:52.360 --> 13:54.260
Run! Now!

13:55.000 --> 13:55.870
Sister!

13:55.960 --> 13:56.810
Go!

13:58.000 --> 13:58.670
Sister!

13:58.670 --> 13:59.490
Sister!

14:02.320 --> 14:03.200
Sister!

14:03.220 --> 14:05.810
Release my sister!

14:06.030 --> 14:07.200
Sister!

14:07.750 --> 14:09.200
Sister!

14:10.960 --> 14:12.600
You can come at me!

14:12.750 --> 14:14.610
But leave my little sister alone!

14:24.030 --> 14:26.750
I guess you must be feeling terrible right now.

14:26.960 --> 14:29.150
We, the Nangong family, caught you

14:30.000 --> 14:33.150
to extract your demon cores for sword forging.

14:33.670 --> 14:36.290
But not every lowly demon

14:36.390 --> 14:38.270
is qualified for this.

14:38.440 --> 14:40.510
We want the strongest

14:40.790 --> 14:42.240
and the most stubborn ones

14:42.240 --> 14:43.990
with the deepest resentment.

14:44.200 --> 14:47.470
I hope you all die a horrible death!

14:47.750 --> 14:49.810
Your resentment is still not enough.

14:54.390 --> 14:57.030
Don't touch my little sister! Come at me!

14:57.030 --> 14:59.110
Let go of my sister!

14:59.200 --> 15:00.160
Sister!

15:01.120 --> 15:02.440
Sister!

15:04.870 --> 15:06.000
Sister...

15:06.000 --> 15:07.080
Sister!

15:07.080 --> 15:08.080
Help!

15:09.550 --> 15:12.840
I won't let you off even if I die!

15:13.240 --> 15:15.090
Help!

15:16.550 --> 15:18.380
That's enough now.

15:18.830 --> 15:20.130
You did it!

15:27.910 --> 15:28.640
Who's there?

15:33.240 --> 15:33.790
Sister...

15:33.790 --> 15:35.150
Sister, sister.

15:35.150 --> 15:37.240
Your master is so brutal.

15:37.440 --> 15:40.130
Why don't you try to stab him too?

15:43.970 --> 15:45.610
Good boy.

15:46.550 --> 15:47.390
Who are you?

15:48.340 --> 15:51.010
How dare you ruin our Nangong family's plan?

15:56.440 --> 15:58.180
Oh, the famous Nangong family!

15:58.630 --> 16:00.060
I'm so scared!

15:59.640 --> 16:02.560
[Wangquan Zui from Mask Group]

16:03.340 --> 16:06.280
[Yang Yitan from Mask Group]

16:06.870 --> 16:08.630
I was wondering who it was.

16:09.840 --> 16:12.900
Turns out to be you two bitches from the Mask Group.

16:13.400 --> 16:15.400
What are you waiting for?

16:15.420 --> 16:16.430
Kill them!

16:32.320 --> 16:34.720
Take 3 steps to the left; slash to the right.

16:34.830 --> 16:36.730
Block the left side with your sword; take a step back; move to the right.

16:36.730 --> 16:37.220
Dodge.

16:46.960 --> 16:49.240
Yitan, are you really just talking and doing nothing?

16:49.240 --> 16:50.900
Yes, since you're so capable.

16:51.790 --> 16:53.310
You good-for-nothings!

16:54.000 --> 16:54.910
Get them!

17:05.160 --> 17:07.220
You didn't do it like you said, Yitan.

17:14.440 --> 17:16.230
I had already held back.

17:16.310 --> 17:20.310
Didn't expect you to have the guts to attack us while we were not looking.

17:26.310 --> 17:28.160
Surprised, huh?

17:44.790 --> 17:47.390
[Sky-breaking Temple]

17:50.830 --> 17:51.680
Hongye.

17:52.830 --> 17:53.830
Hongye!

17:52.930 --> 17:54.160
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

18:03.640 --> 18:05.230
My son, Hongye.

18:05.400 --> 18:08.510
This tree feeds on hatred.

18:09.160 --> 18:13.510
Forsaking emotions, pursuing hatred; eternal night befalls.

18:14.040 --> 18:18.180
There will be no peace in the world.

18:22.400 --> 18:23.490
Hongye,

18:22.840 --> 18:25.240
[Wangquan Shouzhuo, Master of Wangquan Manor, Yiqi Alliance]

18:23.740 --> 18:25.490
you must remember my words.

18:25.900 --> 18:28.310
Stop the conflict between humans and demons

18:28.310 --> 18:30.910
and prevent the eternal night from befalling.

18:33.070 --> 18:34.400
It was that dream again.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.030
I've been having

18:36.680 --> 18:38.920
the same dream repeatedly for 3 years.

18:45.130 --> 18:50.430
[Wangquan Hongye from Wangquan Party of Yiqi Alliance]

19:20.440 --> 19:21.720
It took a month

19:22.050 --> 19:24.440
and consumed countless spiritual stones.

19:24.440 --> 19:25.300
What's the use?

19:26.000 --> 19:28.330
This top can gather the energy in the world

19:28.440 --> 19:30.550
and spin for a month by itself.

19:32.170 --> 19:34.170
How's it? Can you make it?

19:35.110 --> 19:35.920
Useless.

19:36.510 --> 19:37.440
And ugly too.

19:38.450 --> 19:39.720
Sorry, I'm late.

19:39.790 --> 19:42.390
I'll make it up with delicious food and drinks.

19:44.490 --> 19:45.250
Here.

19:45.900 --> 19:47.360
Char siu from Yunhe Tower.

19:47.440 --> 19:48.880
Vegetarian cakes from Su Jin Ji.

19:48.880 --> 19:51.680
-And desserts from Huayun Pavilion.
-I want this.

19:53.000 --> 19:54.960
Hongye, come out.

19:55.070 --> 19:57.930
-It's your favorite date-paste cake!
-Delicious.

20:01.240 --> 20:03.500
This is the map of Nangong Sword Furnace.

20:04.380 --> 20:05.240
After nightfall.

20:05.240 --> 20:07.070
the Xuanyin Formation will be activated outside the Sword Furnace

20:07.070 --> 20:07.960
with no guards.

20:08.880 --> 20:09.920
To break this formation,

20:09.920 --> 20:11.380
you need to move in person.

20:13.690 --> 20:15.950
[Divine Fire Villa, Yiqi Alliance]

20:23.240 --> 20:24.510
There's no way!

20:27.000 --> 20:27.530
This one!

20:39.310 --> 20:41.770
How's that? You're out of cards, aren't you?

20:44.030 --> 20:46.830
I'm as still and solid as a mountain.

20:49.830 --> 20:53.200
I'll shatter you with my wind-riding technique.

20:53.880 --> 20:56.910
[Visiting Card]

20:56.000 --> 20:57.600
The Dark-Sword Zhang family

20:57.880 --> 21:01.010
is a nemesis of your Ji family's wind-riding technique.

21:01.590 --> 21:03.290
How about that? You lost, huh?

21:03.440 --> 21:04.510
You're out of cards, right?

21:04.510 --> 21:07.100
How come the Zhang family also came to visit you, Father?

21:07.100 --> 21:09.640
[Dongfang Churi, Father of Huaizhu and Qinlan, Master of Divine Fire Villa, Yiqi Alliance]

21:08.540 --> 21:11.540
The Zhang family didn't come for a marriage proposal.

21:12.110 --> 21:14.790
Then I'll have to...

21:16.680 --> 21:18.790
The Mask Group Leader, your nemesis!

21:20.510 --> 21:22.160
[Visiting Card]

21:21.200 --> 21:22.070
Qinlan,

21:22.240 --> 21:23.000
well...

21:23.000 --> 21:24.830
The Mask Group Leader?

21:24.880 --> 21:26.160
Who is this?

21:26.310 --> 21:27.440
There's no such a card!

21:27.440 --> 21:28.270
Besides,

21:28.310 --> 21:31.310
the Dark Sword is known as the second-strongest sword in the Yiqi Alliance.

21:31.310 --> 21:32.400
This so-called

21:32.720 --> 21:34.160
Mask Group Leader.

21:34.350 --> 21:35.810
how could he be my nemesis?

21:36.000 --> 21:39.920
Unless you have a visiting card from the Wangquan family.

21:40.350 --> 21:41.880
You don't understand.

21:42.070 --> 21:43.920
My sister never cares about the worldly things.

21:43.920 --> 21:46.170
She's aloof to outsiders.

21:46.270 --> 21:49.400
How could she possibly like these noble family members?

21:50.440 --> 21:51.240
You're right.

21:52.000 --> 21:54.880
But Huaizhu has feelings

21:55.640 --> 21:57.170
for this Mask Group Leader.

22:00.440 --> 22:01.790
Well,

22:02.340 --> 22:03.750
Huaizhu has feelings for him,

22:03.750 --> 22:05.480
or he has feelings for Huaizhu?

22:06.440 --> 22:07.540
Curious?

22:07.680 --> 22:08.790
Then admit defeat.

22:08.880 --> 22:10.440
If you admit defeat, I'll tell you the story

22:10.440 --> 22:12.440
of how Huaizhu met the chosen one

22:12.440 --> 22:14.160
while we went up the mountain to gather herbs.

22:14.160 --> 22:16.270
Come on, stick it, stick it.

22:16.270 --> 22:18.400
And tell me the story once you're done.

22:18.720 --> 22:19.520
Stick it here.

22:23.240 --> 22:24.300
What are you doing?

22:27.240 --> 22:28.440
Well, um...

22:30.240 --> 22:34.030
The matchmakers flooded in again.

22:34.400 --> 22:36.110
They all came

22:36.110 --> 22:38.070
for your Demon-Slaying Fire.

22:38.590 --> 22:39.440
That doesn't mean

22:39.440 --> 22:41.790
you can play their visiting cards.

22:44.350 --> 22:47.110
We did this

22:49.670 --> 22:50.540
to criticize them.

22:50.540 --> 22:51.600
Qinlan's right.

22:52.350 --> 22:53.750
We were criticizing them!

22:53.750 --> 22:55.680
Look at all this

22:55.680 --> 22:57.000
motley crew with fishy intentions.

22:57.000 --> 22:57.920
Ignore them.

22:57.920 --> 22:58.590
Yeah.

22:58.590 --> 22:59.520
Out! All of them!

23:00.960 --> 23:02.100
So, Qinlan,

23:02.640 --> 23:04.970
have you done your abacus practice today?

23:05.960 --> 23:06.690
Father,

23:07.310 --> 23:09.440
have you taken your medicine today?

23:10.590 --> 23:12.510
I'm hungry. Isn't it time to eat?

23:12.510 --> 23:13.510
Let me clean this up.

23:13.510 --> 23:14.440
Let me do it.

23:14.510 --> 23:16.160
Leave these tiring chores to me.

23:16.160 --> 23:16.960
I'll do it.

23:17.510 --> 23:19.110
I want to act like a good daughter.

23:19.110 --> 23:20.510
You can forget about it.

23:20.510 --> 23:23.510
Qinlan can move today's abacus practice to tomorrow,

23:23.930 --> 23:25.600
but Father can't miss his medicine today.

23:25.600 --> 23:26.860
I'll go bring it to you.

23:27.440 --> 23:29.030
Good medicine tastes bitter, but it works.

23:29.030 --> 23:29.920
Uncle Churi,

23:29.920 --> 23:31.520
please let Zhu rest assured.

23:31.790 --> 23:32.590
Yang!

23:32.240 --> 23:34.430
[Yang Yan, the Clairvoyant Yang Family of Yiqi Alliance]

23:39.370 --> 23:41.570
[Wangquan Manor, Yiqi Alliance]

23:41.750 --> 23:45.320
[Unparalleled Sword]

23:46.640 --> 23:47.440
Young Master.

23:48.270 --> 23:49.750
Those heads of noble families

23:49.750 --> 23:51.550
are waiting in the meeting hall.

23:51.720 --> 23:54.000
They seem to be here with ill intentions.

23:54.470 --> 23:57.430
[Unparalleled Sword]

23:54.830 --> 23:56.560
Any news of my father recently?

23:56.750 --> 23:57.830
No.

23:58.400 --> 24:01.200
Nangong Ye seems to be getting suspicious as well.

24:01.270 --> 24:03.440
He doubts that our master is not traveling out there

24:03.440 --> 24:04.240
as we claimed.

24:06.930 --> 24:14.610
[Unparalleled Sword]

24:09.070 --> 24:12.070
That's why they're getting more and more rampant now.

24:12.350 --> 24:14.030
The Nangong family is growing stronger.

24:14.030 --> 24:17.490
Be careful, Young Master, he might be planning to seize power.

24:22.730 --> 24:25.140
[Meeting Hall, Wangquan Manor]

24:24.920 --> 24:27.720
-Young Master Wangquan!
-Young Master Wangquan!

24:30.020 --> 24:31.340
[Gu Henian, Master of Gu Family, Yiqi Alliance]

24:31.720 --> 24:32.960
[Cheng Ling, Master of Cheng Family, Yiqi Alliance]

24:33.310 --> 24:35.000
[Zhang Zheng, Master of Zhang Family, Yiqi Alliance]

24:35.910 --> 24:37.240
Young Master Wangquan,

24:38.440 --> 24:40.170
everyone here is one of our own.

24:40.310 --> 24:42.240
So no beating around the bush then.

24:42.310 --> 24:43.960
Young Master, when will you issue an order

24:43.960 --> 24:46.510
to have all the clans attack Nanchui?

24:51.210 --> 24:54.570
[Yiqi Alliance]

24:51.530 --> 24:53.460
The Alliance Leader's token is here.

24:53.460 --> 24:55.810
Master Nangong, issue your order now.

25:03.160 --> 25:04.870
The Yiqi Alliance

25:05.830 --> 25:07.360
is led by Wangquan Manor.

25:08.310 --> 25:10.270
You're in charge of everything for now, Young Master.

25:10.270 --> 25:13.440
How could I overstep my bounds?

25:16.940 --> 25:19.030
Regarding Master Nangong's proposal

25:19.030 --> 25:20.640
to mobilize the forces of Yiqi Alliance

25:20.640 --> 25:21.990
and attack Nanchui.

25:23.350 --> 25:25.080
Young Master, here's a report!

25:28.640 --> 25:29.790
Esteemed family masters,

25:29.790 --> 25:30.720
Nanchui Poison King

25:30.720 --> 25:32.510
sent someone to deliver a letter of surrender.

25:32.150 --> 25:33.810
[Letter of Surrender]

25:34.200 --> 25:37.060
Demons are always cunning and dangerous by nature.

25:37.350 --> 25:38.550
It's too late for them

25:39.440 --> 25:40.440
to surrender now.

25:41.270 --> 25:42.750
They also sent this item

25:43.720 --> 25:45.580
along with the surrender letter.

25:55.240 --> 25:57.900
It's the Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord's demon core.

26:02.130 --> 26:04.330
The Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord already offered his demon core.

26:04.330 --> 26:05.860
Let's end this matter here.

26:08.320 --> 26:10.360
[Nangong's residence, Yiqi Alliance]

26:15.880 --> 26:16.810
Master Nangong,

26:17.200 --> 26:18.010
are we really

26:19.350 --> 26:22.190
going to listen to that Wangquan brat?

26:24.200 --> 26:26.930
Didn't you hear what Young Master Wangquan said?

26:29.110 --> 26:33.240
The Poison King already submitted the Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord's demon core.

26:33.240 --> 26:36.490
If our Yiqi Alliance still not lets it go,

26:36.640 --> 26:38.550
it will cause chaos among the demons

26:38.550 --> 26:41.210
and inevitably bring disaster upon ourselves.

26:42.960 --> 26:44.590
Wangquan Hongye,

26:44.790 --> 26:46.550
he ruined my big plan.

26:52.110 --> 26:54.440
The Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord's demon core

26:54.680 --> 26:57.510
came at such a perfect time. That's weird.

27:00.160 --> 27:01.070
Indeed,

27:02.440 --> 27:04.200
perfect timing. So fishy.

27:07.240 --> 27:08.750
Our Young Master Wangquan

27:09.720 --> 27:11.000
is like the sky,

27:12.110 --> 27:13.920
seemingly peaceful and clear,

27:15.160 --> 27:17.420
yet hiding storms and gathering clouds.

27:17.720 --> 27:21.180
The Nangong family is not holding sway over the Yiqi Alliance.

27:21.480 --> 27:23.880
If this little brat, Hongye, doesn't obey,

27:24.200 --> 27:26.030
we can just kill him.

27:41.830 --> 27:43.430
Has anyone ever told you that

27:43.490 --> 27:46.290
Miss Dongfang looks gorgeous when preparing tea?

27:47.700 --> 27:49.570
Has anyone ever told you that

27:49.830 --> 27:52.350
the Yang family's young lady who doesn't drink

27:52.350 --> 27:53.680
speaks in a strange way?

27:55.440 --> 27:58.100
I've told you that I'm under the weather lately.

28:00.070 --> 28:00.720
What?

28:01.110 --> 28:04.040
Are you upset because I don't drink with you at night?

28:04.110 --> 28:04.750
Yang Yan,

28:06.640 --> 28:08.500
you're not acting like yourself.

28:15.200 --> 28:17.920
Every time I see how harmonious your family is,

28:18.160 --> 28:19.160
I feel so envious.

28:23.030 --> 28:25.160
And the food at your home is especially palatable

28:25.160 --> 28:26.300
with a homey vibe.

28:30.880 --> 28:32.880
Did you come all the way here

28:34.310 --> 28:35.440
to meet me today

28:37.400 --> 28:39.590
just to beat around the bush with me?

28:42.030 --> 28:43.830
I'm here just to visit you today.

28:46.000 --> 28:47.000
Did

28:47.000 --> 28:48.730
something happen to Mu Xiaowu?

28:49.680 --> 28:52.220
Or does your father not allow you

28:52.310 --> 28:53.970
to date him because he's poor?

28:55.680 --> 28:56.720
If my father disliked him,

28:56.720 --> 28:58.250
I would just leave with him.

29:03.750 --> 29:04.350
Well...

29:06.510 --> 29:07.350
Xiaowu...

29:10.400 --> 29:11.600
What happened to him?

29:12.510 --> 29:14.270
When he was supervising in the mine,

29:14.270 --> 29:17.130
he let a little demon escape in a moment of weakness.

29:17.240 --> 29:19.700
Someone reported this to the Yiqi Alliance.

29:20.310 --> 29:21.240
Xiaowu...

29:24.070 --> 29:26.470
He was taken away by the Inspection Bureau.

29:29.310 --> 29:32.310
The Nangong family holds sway over the Inspection Bureau alone,

29:32.310 --> 29:34.710
using it to coerce the other major families

29:34.840 --> 29:36.170
and the Wangquan Manor.

29:37.070 --> 29:39.030
Our Yang family has little influence.

29:39.030 --> 29:41.630
Even my father's intervention can't help him.

29:42.920 --> 29:46.180
I'm worried that, in a place like the Inspection Bureau...

29:49.590 --> 29:50.850
There must be a way out.

29:52.500 --> 29:53.910
There must be a way.

29:58.350 --> 29:59.750
Yeah, there must be a way.

30:04.440 --> 30:06.040
I didn't plan to bring this up

30:06.790 --> 30:08.390
when I came to meet you today.

30:09.550 --> 30:11.550
It'd only make you worry.

30:15.640 --> 30:17.200
I just don't know if I'll...

30:29.050 --> 30:31.250
If you don't want me to check your pulse,

30:31.440 --> 30:32.310
just tell me

30:33.680 --> 30:35.880
the real reason why you

30:36.030 --> 30:37.240
can't drink.

30:41.620 --> 30:43.280
I'm carrying Xiaowu's child.

30:57.920 --> 31:00.750
Other family masters are dissatisfied with the Wangquans.

31:00.750 --> 31:02.620
They want me to take over.

31:03.110 --> 31:05.970
Wangquan Shouzhuo has been missing for a long time.

31:06.510 --> 31:09.000
That coward, Wangquan Hongye, is nowhere near

31:09.000 --> 31:11.060
qualified to lead the Yiqi Alliance.

31:11.780 --> 31:13.180
He is a coward?

31:13.810 --> 31:16.290
Ever since he took over the Yiqi Alliance,

31:16.340 --> 31:19.140
the Wangquan Sword has never been drawn even once.

31:19.790 --> 31:21.650
If that's not cowardice, what is?

31:22.590 --> 31:25.250
Our Nangong family is gaining ground right now.

31:25.590 --> 31:28.520
You should seize the chance and make a decisive move!

31:30.160 --> 31:33.510
The unsheathed sword doesn't necessarily mean cowardice.

31:35.200 --> 31:36.750
It's more likely that

31:37.680 --> 31:39.310
he wants to deal a fatal blow.

31:46.590 --> 31:47.760
This demon sword

31:48.830 --> 31:50.760
will be completed in ten days.

31:51.200 --> 31:54.210
When the time comes, I will host a night banquet.

31:54.310 --> 31:56.190
I will invite Wangquan Hongye

31:56.920 --> 31:58.790
and the major families to it.

32:00.180 --> 32:03.680
You mean to trap them?

32:06.510 --> 32:09.640
The fire in this furnace is not fierce enough now.

32:10.350 --> 32:11.030
Remember,

32:11.680 --> 32:14.340
only despair will make this fire burn stronger.

32:14.920 --> 32:16.360
Be it humans or demons,

32:16.440 --> 32:19.680
they all have something foolish that they can't let go of.

32:19.830 --> 32:21.160
It's emotion.

32:21.920 --> 32:23.920
This is their weakness.

32:25.030 --> 32:26.440
I got it.

32:26.720 --> 32:28.440
I'll go arrange it right away.

32:29.680 --> 32:31.210
As for Wangquan Hongye,

32:32.070 --> 32:34.400
I will pay a visit to the Divine Fire Villa.

32:35.640 --> 32:38.830
In this world, only the Divine Fire can counter the Wangquan Sword.

32:38.830 --> 32:42.030
Father, aren't you afraid that after getting rid of the wolf,

32:42.030 --> 32:43.560
we might face a tiger again?

32:45.720 --> 32:48.650
The Divine Fire Villa has been in seclusion for years

32:48.960 --> 32:50.290
with a great reputation

32:50.680 --> 32:51.830
but no real power.

32:52.590 --> 32:54.190
Inviting the Divine Fire out

32:54.830 --> 32:56.830
will surely guarantee our victory.

32:57.750 --> 33:00.880
I want everyone in the world to see that

33:01.350 --> 33:03.030
Dongfang Divine Fire

33:03.510 --> 33:05.920
is siding with our Nangong family.

33:17.960 --> 33:18.510
Huaizhu!

33:22.110 --> 33:23.170
Where's Miss Yang?

33:24.590 --> 33:25.350
She left.

33:27.000 --> 33:27.830
Huaizhu,

33:27.880 --> 33:30.790
you look kind of depressed. What's up?

33:34.640 --> 33:35.640
As you know,

33:37.240 --> 33:39.070
Yang Yan is my only friend

33:39.440 --> 33:40.550
in Yiqi Alliance.

33:41.510 --> 33:42.710
Of course I know that.

33:42.920 --> 33:44.180
You've told me before.

33:44.440 --> 33:46.440
You two were classmates when you were young.

33:46.440 --> 33:49.510
She's as lovely as warm jade.

33:51.270 --> 33:52.310
All this time,

33:53.550 --> 33:54.790
I've believed that

33:55.240 --> 33:58.040
the Divine Fire Villa's seclusion from the world,

33:58.640 --> 34:00.070
our family's harmony,

34:00.790 --> 34:02.450
and giving up fame and fortune

34:02.790 --> 34:04.320
were all the right choices.

34:05.810 --> 34:06.850
But now,

34:07.880 --> 34:09.739
we're far from the Yiqi Alliance,

34:12.360 --> 34:14.440
and I can't even help my best friend.

34:17.580 --> 34:18.460
So, Qinlan,

34:19.760 --> 34:20.620
is there really

34:22.400 --> 34:24.280
a utopia in this world?

34:29.710 --> 34:31.630
Miss Huaizhu, we have a visitor.

34:31.800 --> 34:33.510
He claimed to be the Master of the Nangong family

34:33.510 --> 34:36.000
and specifically asked to see you, Miss Huaizhu.

34:36.000 --> 34:37.030
Nangong Ye?

34:38.150 --> 34:39.480
The Inspection Bureau?

34:51.360 --> 34:52.360
Mr. Nangong.

34:55.880 --> 34:57.230
Sir, what brings you

34:57.230 --> 34:58.760
here today?

34:58.760 --> 35:00.220
Please feel free to speak.

35:00.590 --> 35:03.190
Miss Dongfang, you're quite straightforward.

35:03.190 --> 35:06.250
There's indeed something I'd like to discuss with you.

35:06.800 --> 35:09.000
The Yiqi Alliance is deeply corrupted.

35:09.000 --> 35:10.670
The blame lies with the Wangquan family.

35:10.670 --> 35:12.510
I am determined to replace them.

35:13.230 --> 35:16.030
I humbly request your assistance, Miss Dongfang,

35:16.030 --> 35:18.430
in capturing and killing Wangquan Hongye.

35:19.760 --> 35:20.760
Mr. Nangong,

35:21.880 --> 35:22.760
what can I get

35:23.400 --> 35:24.360
if I help you?

35:27.710 --> 35:30.040
As long as we can bring down the Wangquans,

35:30.280 --> 35:31.440
I can give you

35:32.070 --> 35:33.440
whatever you need.

35:38.710 --> 35:42.190
Young Master, you just rejected Nangong Ye's proposal to attack Nanchui,

35:42.190 --> 35:44.590
so he's now holding a grand sword-opening ceremony.

35:44.590 --> 35:45.940
At this ceremony,

35:46.230 --> 35:49.760
he will surely propose to promote using demon cores in sword forging.

35:49.760 --> 35:51.280
If you reject it again,

35:51.360 --> 35:54.090
it will be openly making an enemy of the Nangongs.

35:54.840 --> 35:56.170
We are already enemies.

35:56.800 --> 35:59.260
It's just making the hostility aboveboard.

36:00.030 --> 36:02.030
Will you go attend it, Young Master?

36:02.670 --> 36:04.440
For the treacherous banquet in ten days,

36:04.440 --> 36:06.440
inform Zui to bring Yang Yitan along

36:06.630 --> 36:07.510
and go attend it with me.
